# Requests of the extra of lab 4.1 (REV-11), in the order of "Check it" in the lab booklet.
# Start first: EventServiceApp (port 8084), then your review-service, started fresh.
@reviewUrl = http://localhost:8083

### A link in the text
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"author": "Alice", "stars": 5, "text": "Cheap tickets at https://tickets.example"}

### A review to change
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"author": "Alice", "stars": 4, "text": "Good evening."}

### PUT with a link in the text
PUT {{reviewUrl}}/api/reviews/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"stars": 4, "text": "More at WWW.tickets.example"}

### PUT without a link
PUT {{reviewUrl}}/api/reviews/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"stars": 4, "text": "Who needs http anyway."}
